; sidecar_test_eos2.logo
; Print EndToken value directly at first hook call.
PrintBanner "EndToken value"
Print EndToken                                    ; the end-of-text token id the engine compares against
PrintBanner "first TOK value"
Print :TokenNumber                               ; the token id of this, the first, hook call
